      "Patience (sabr) does not mean waiting with a heavy heart — it means doing your duty with trust in Allah when every sign around you says to give up.",
      "Long ago, in a valley where the river had grown thin, there lived a farmer named Yusuf whose grandfather had farmed the same field before him. One spring, the rains did not come. The soil cracked into pale islands, and Yusuf's neighbours stopped their ploughs, saying, \"Why throw seed into dust?\"",
